{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Recheck scope fatals at the response boundary.** This is the last check, so a timed-out scope reporting `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` during a blocked invocation-end hook or `ExecutionManager.close()` still lets the caller return `PENDING` or the original retry outcome. Preserve the selected outcome through end dispatch and manager closure, then check `scopeFatal` immediately before returning or rethrowing it.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77FyAm","finding_digest":"5944175c7faa8fd30d7a603075dc2afe7e9726af48f33d923651740f246bc428","finding_id":"arf_v1_lfcboxd7vkh5gdl2mayhlxbk7z","finding_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-scope-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-scope-cleanup-propagation","line":450,"observation_digest":"80ceb20cc6e233d3656b31168685e80501de46787c208a3b6c7e4f708598217d","observation_id":"aro_v1_qdhledgg4iz5gzllgelinbpiau","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_lfcboxd7vkh5gdl2mayhlxbk7z","published_at":"2026-10-07T22:19:53Z","review_id":"arr_v1_4gc7yhfcnaxduusi4sn4j47wty","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"7c52725a86997b2322cf2654da198ebd8aaa11a8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":450,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_4ldrrgeu6fimionwrsk2yygre6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T22:19:53Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
